;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=1224, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=410, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=262, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=17, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ ゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=2141, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1925, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>In March, Shiyo 729, a certain visitor arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The visitor was riding in a fine automobile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With someone like that suddenly appearing, the residents began to stir as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were residents wary of outsiders at the best of times.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I watched the scene from the window of the house, and the visitor seemed to be heading our way.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Pardon the intrusion!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The visitor</STYLE> opened the door of the Niimura house and shouted those words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"May I ask who you are?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now 65 years old, I feigned calm and received the visitor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">This visitor's</STYLE> back was ramrod straight, the expression firm and set.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the mid-thirties, I would guess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a salute, the stance quietly eased.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed to be the utmost show of courtesy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\篠崎ハジメ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I have been dispatched by the government, and my name is Hajime Shinozaki!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I have a matter to discuss with the representative of this settlement, and so I have come from Tokyo!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The government...? What business could <STYLE ID="1">such a visitor</STYLE> possibly have?<PG>
I was somewhat wary, but if this person had come all the way from Tokyo alone, I could hardly send such a visitor away out of hand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Please, come in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond the open door―from the hedge of the Niimura house, the residents stared suspiciously at <STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> tried anything strange―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That situation, too, played its part in my deciding to invite him in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I offered him tea and sweets.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\茶菓子.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, I am much obliged."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> savored the tea and sweets without reserve.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even by car, anyone who had come so far under this cold sky would surely be hungry.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I am Kikyo Niimura, the representative of this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What might your business be?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I waited until <STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> had drained his tea before raising the matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> took a sheet of paper from his bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It appeared to be an old letter.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> silently unfolded the letter and held it out before me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\晃の書簡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I have come from Arata, a remote region.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those were its opening words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at the end, the signature 'Arata Settlement Representative　Ko Niimura.'<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Ko-san's</STYLE> letter!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The day I first met <STYLE ID="4">Ko-san</STYLE>, our talk by the river, the wedding ceremony, and―
{PAUSE ""}
his death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All of it came rushing back to me at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while, I gazed at the letter.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I have come in the belief that now, of all times, this drug may be of service to the country."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\篠崎ハジメバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san's</STYLE> voice brought me back to myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, I remembered my purpose in marrying into this place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, first and foremost had been my wish to be with <STYLE ID="4">Ko-san</STYLE>, someone irreplaceable to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the other was to uncover the true nature of Droga and the curse-killing.<PG>
Only now did it occur to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why had <STYLE ID="4">Ko-san</STYLE> and Mother killed themselves?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had it truly been suicide?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else...<PG>
I, too, had come to feel my age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had forgotten that purpose and put everyone's safety first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as long as this settlement lived alongside Droga, was that safety not a sham?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such thoughts had crossed my mind now and then.<PG>
But having reached this age, I had begun to question whether things could truly stay as they were.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, in other words, you want the cherry trees here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Your quick grasp of things is a great help. I would ask for your cooperation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You came all the way from Tokyo for that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It is as you say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Have you ever been to Iizawa Prefecture before?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, this is my first time."</STYLE><PG>
At that moment, I saw through <STYLE ID="1">Shinozaki-san's</STYLE> lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This person had not come from Tokyo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For his accent was the way people speak in Iizawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having come from Tokyo myself, I could tell at once.<PG>
―A long silence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is this drug still in use now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that should no longer be so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I lied as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Droga was still in use, even now.<PG>
But I could not see what <STYLE ID="1">this person</STYLE> was after.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What reason could someone from Iizawa Prefecture have for wanting the cherry trees badly enough to lie about being from the government?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you say? The cherry trees here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How many do you need?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If it is possible, we would like as many as you can give."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How would you carry so many cherry trees?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Surely you do not intend to make everyone in Arata carry them?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"C-certainly not! We have no such intention whatsoever!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　It depends on how many you can provide, but we are also considering building a railway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A railway?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Whether it is one tree or a thousand, we will do everything ourselves, from the felling to the hauling."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a strange thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely no one but the state itself could raise the funds to build a railway.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Of course, you will be analyzing Droga scientifically, will you not?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Without fail."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You may take as many as you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I-is that true!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"However, there are conditions."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What might they be...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The conditions I set―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・The cherry tree of the Niimura main house alone is to be left standing
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・The results of the research are to be disclosed to this settlement in writing
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those two.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could not quite bring myself to part with every last cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, who <STYLE ID="1">this man</STYLE> really was remained unknown, but if Droga was to be analyzed scientifically, the truth I had wanted to know―
{PAUSE ""}
and a way to go on truly protecting this settlement would surely become clear.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------